How about Dayton?

90
00:05:42,670 --> 00:05:45,340
Veto. Stewart.

91
00:05:45,550 --> 00:05:47,170
Veto. Sawyer.

92
00:05:47,380 --> 00:05:49,720
Veto. Helen.

93
00:05:47,380 --> 00:05:49,720
Veto.

