Oh, just as well. I broke this one.

192
00:11:51,460 --> 00:11:53,210
What?

193
00:11:51,460 --> 00:11:53,210
Nothing.

194
00:11:53,670 --> 00:11:55,290
Okay.

195
00:11:55,500 --> 00:11:59,340
