234
00:14:21,360 --> 00:14:24,860
And you really do want her to be named Ruth.

235
00:14:25,070 --> 00:14:30,740
Well, I'm not falling for that! Okay? Ruth is off the table!

236
00:14:30,990 --> 00:14:36,370
But, Ross, you want the name Ruth.

237
00:14:30,990 --> 00:14:36,370
Not like this!

238
00:14:38,290 --> 00:14:42,130
Hey.

239
00:14:38,290 --> 00:14:42,130
Hey. What's up?

240
00:14:42,330 --> 00:14:46,420
Um, Joey, I know.

241
00:14:42,330 --> 00:14:46,420
